<h1 class="title" title="Ten Best Places to visit in India">Ten Best Places to visit in India</h1>
					<div class="entry-content">
<p><b><a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/">Traveling in India</a></b>, itself is an enchanting experience for anyone as the country offers the assortment of diverse regions with different geographical and climatic conditions, varied religions and cultures, wide range of customs and traditions. India treasures several <b>wonderful travel destinations</b> worth of visiting like snow peaked mountains, scenic beauty of hill stations, wonderful beaches and lakes, amazing islands, historical forts and palaces, deserts, Wildlife etc. India is globally acclaimed as the <b>major tourist destination</b>. Here are <b>ten best places to visit in India</b> to explore true essence of this magical land!</p>					

<table>
<tr>
<td>
<a href="Uttar-Pradesh-Destinations/Agra.aspx"><strong><i>Taj Mahal: Wonder of world</i></strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/india-tourism.jpeg" alt="Tajmahar, agra, uttar pradesh" class="thumb alignright" style="width:120px;height:100px;float:right"  title="Tajmahal"  />
<p><b><a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/Uttar-Pradesh-Destinations/Agra.aspx">Taj Mahal, Agra</a></b> is proudly listed amidst <b>Seven Wonders of the World</b>. This exquisite love monument is located on the banks of River Yamuna in <b>Agra, Uttar Pradesh</b>. This eternal symbol of love was built by Shah Jahan in the memory of his beloved wife Mumtaz Mahal.<a href="Uttar-Pradesh-Destinations/Agra.aspx">MORE...</a> 
</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<a href="Jammu-kashmir.aspx"><strong><i>Kashmir: Heaven on Earth</i></strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/jammu kashmir.jpg" style="width:120px;height:100px;float:left" class="thumb alignleft"  alt="kashmir, jammu kashmir" title="Kashmir"  />
<p><b><a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/Jammu-Kashmir.aspx">Kashmir</a></b> is the awesome place on the planet Earth. As it is popularly said "If there is Heaven, it's here, it's here, it's here". The unforgettable beauty of the place includes spectacular view of Himalayas, serene lakes, <b>natural landscapes</b>, houseboats etc. <a href="Jammu-kashmir.aspx">MORE...</a> </p>
<br/>
<br/>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<a href="Kerala.aspx"><strong><i>Kerala: God's own Place </i></strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/Kerala-Coconut.jpg" alt="Kerala" class="thumb alignright" title="Kerala"  style="width:120px;height:100px;float:right" />
<p><b><a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/kerala.aspx">Kerala</a></b> is a serene and calm place, blessed with exceptional natural beauty. The delightful place is located in southern part of the country along the Arabian Sea. Major alluring features of the place include lush green forests, ancient temples, breathtaking backwaters, luxurious houseboats etc.<a href="Kerala.aspx">MORE...</a> </p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<a href="Rajasthan.aspx"><strong><i>Rajasthan: Royal Land</i></strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/rajasthan-tour.jpeg" style="width:120px;height:100px;float:left" class="thumb alignleft"  alt="Rajasthan, royal land" title="Rajasthan tour"  />
<p><a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/rajasthan.aspx">Rajasthan</a> offers blend of tourist options like <b>heritage tourism, camel safari, wildlife tourism</b> etc. Rajasthan depicts the glorious past of its former kings. Rajasthan is acclaimed worldwide for its magnificent forts, palaces and luxurious hospitability.<a href="Rajasthan.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
<br/>
<br/>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<a href="Goa.aspx"><strong><i>Goa: Basket of Exotic Beaches</i></strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/goa.jpeg" alt="Goa" title="Goa" class="thumb alignright"  style="width:120px;height:100px;float:right" />
<p><a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/goa.aspx">Goa</a>, thought the smallest state of India, is always found crowded with tourists. The immensely popular place is said traveler's delight as it offers an array of visual treat in the form of its <b>exotic beaches</b> and opulent churches.<a href="Goa.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<a href="#"><strong><i>Khajuraho: Specimen of Impeccable Architecture</i></strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/khajuraho.jpeg" alt="Khajuraho" title="Khajuraho" class="thumb alignleft"  style="width:120px;height:100px;float:left" />
<p><b>Khajuraho</b> is a group of <b>fascinating temples</b> located in <b><a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/madhya-pradesh.aspx">Madhya Pradesh</a></b> and acclaimed world wide for its great work of art. Temples display balance between masterpiece architecture and <b>erotic sculptures</b> engraved on walls.<a href="#">MORE...</a></p>
<br/>
<br/>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<a href="Himachal-Pradesh-Destinations/Manali.aspx"><strong><i>Manali: Vigilant Hill Station</i></strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/manali.jpg" alt="manali, himachal pradesh" title="manali tour" class="thumb alignright"  style="width:120px;height:100px;float:right" />
<p>Manali or <q>India's Switzerland</q> is a lovely hill station in <b><a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/himachal-pradesh.aspx">Himachal Pradesh</a></b>. The place is popularly known as perfect <b>honeymoon destination</b> as love birds get lost in the spell bound natural beauty of snow capped valleys, hot springs, ancient temples etc.<a href="Himachal-Pradesh-Destinations/Manali.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<a href="Ooty.aspx"><strong><i>Ooty: Queen of Hills</i></strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/Tamilnadu/Ooty.jpg" alt="ooty, tamil nadu" title="ooty tourism" class="thumb alignleft"  style="width:120px;height:100px;float:left" />
<p>Ooty is heavenly <b><a href="https://www.hill-stations.info/" target="_blank">hill station</a></b> located in the western ghats of Nilgiri Hills. The place is blessed with nature’s pristine glory in the form of lush green tea gardens, evergreen rolling hills; dense eucalyptus and pine forests, mesmerizing toy train etc.<a href="Ooty.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
<br/>
<br/>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<a href="Union-Territories/Andaman-and-Nicobar.aspx"><strong><i>Andaman & Nicobar Islands:  Emerald Islands</i></strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/Imphal.jpg" alt="Imphal tour" title="Imphal tour"  style="width:120px;height:100px;float:right" class="thumb alignright" />
<p>Located in eastern part of Bay of Bengal,<a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/Union-Territories/Andaman-and-Nicobar.aspx" >Andaman & Nicobar Islands</a> is a group of 572 emerald islands. These <b>most delightful islands</b> offer visual delight to tourists in the form of clear blue sea, tall coconut trees, colorful corals, underwater marine life etc.<a href="Union-Territories/Andaman-and-Nicobar.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<a href="Andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/Tirupati.aspx"><strong><i>Tirupati Balaji: Sacred Pilgrimage</i></strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/Tirupati/tirupati-tirumala-balaji-image.gif" alt="tirumala balaji, tirupati, lord balaji" title="Tirumala Balaji" class="thumb alignleft"  style="width:120px;height:100px;float:left" />
<p><a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/Andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/Tirupati.aspx" >Tirupati Balaji </a>is the worldwide <b>most popular spiritual shrine</b> of Lord Venkateshwara located on the seventh peak of the Tirupati Hills, in the state of Andhra Pradesh. Balaji temple daily encounters huge number of pilgrims from all around the globe.<a href="Andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/Tirupati.aspx">MORE...</a> </p>
<br/>
<br/>
</td>
</tr>
</table>                   

